      164.85,
      203.57,
      398.85,
      214.91
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE VALUE ADDED TAX ACT, NO. 14 OF 2002",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.61,
      401.9,
      253.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.87,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Value Added Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.92,
      383.99
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2A of the Value Added Tax Act, No.14 of2002 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended by the deletion of subsections (2), (3), (4)and (5) thereof, and the substitution therefor of the followingnew subsections which shall take effect as subsections (2)and (3) thereof:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.13,
      398.57,
      401.86,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2)Every such Order shall be published in the Gazette,and shall as soon as convenient thereafter be placedbefore Parliament for its approval.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      450.53,
      401.86,
      474.95
    ],
    "text": "(3)Such Order shall only come into force upon itsapproval by Parliament.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      487.97,
      401.9,
      512.87
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
